## Self-exclusion note

Zero verified public benchmark numbers were found for this exact model/ID (`qwen3.5-plus`) as of 2026-10-01: the official QwenLM/Qwen3.8 repo and Qwen3.5 blog publish benchmark charts only for the OPEN model sizes (397B-A17B, 122B-A10B, 35B-A3B, 27B, 9B, 4B — image-based charts, and for different models anyway); CloudPrice does not track a plain `qwen3.5-plus` entry (no specs); qwen.ai blog pages render empty without JavaScript; Bing/DuckDuckGo searches surfaced nothing for the Plus tier. Saved as `.md.excluded` per the mandatory self-exclusion rule (`RULES.md`, `model-report-TEMPLATE.md`): no scores computed, no placeholder numbers invented. The pricing/endpoint facts above are verified (OpenCode Zen) and may be reused once benchmark data appears.

